Hi all,

Following the latest RAG optimization and Knowledge Base updates, we are now ready to launch the second round of UAT for the MyIAM RAG Chatbot.

As the Twin environment is not fully ready yet, the second round of UAT will be performed on Auria, similarly to the first round of testing.

The objective of this second round of testing is mainly to validate:
- the correction of previously identified issues
- the improvement of response quality
- the overall consistency and relevance of chatbot answers
- the absence of regression on previously correct responses

