### 2. New business questions
In addition, each tester is requested to ask the chatbot 3–5 representative questions related to their own domain/activity while putting themselves in the position of an end user.

## Testing Process

- Go to: Auria (Open WebUI)
- Please select the model: “MyIAM - LightRAG” (updated Knowledge Base version)
- Ask your business questions to the chatbot

## Validation Process

- If the response is correct → please click 👍
- If the response is incorrect, incomplete, or outdated → please click 👎 and leave a comment explaining:
  - why the answer is incorrect
  - what the expected/correct answer should be

Please do not forget to save your comment.

